<title>FRANCE: Machinery top value Paris '96 air exports to NAmerica.</title>
<headline>Machinery top value Paris '96 air exports to NAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Machinery, motors, equipment and parts was the most valuable category of exports to North America from the Paris airports, Charles de Gaulle and Orly in 1996 French Ministry of Transport (MoT) figures showed.</p>
<p>The top ten categories of goods, in terms of customs  value, expressed in millions of French francs, exported from the Paris airports to North America in 1996, with 1995 comparisons were:</p>
<p>					    1996	1995</p>
<p>    1. Machinery, motors	   16,800    16,800</p>
<p>equipment &amp; parts</p>
<p>    2. Assorted manufactured     11,500    13,900</p>
<p>goods</p>
<p>    3. Travel goods/garments/     1,900     1,900</p>
<p>hosiery/footwear</p>
<p>    4. Vehicles/transport	   1,100     1,000</p>
<p>equipment/parts</p>
<p>    5. Perfumes			   913	 864</p>
<p>    6. Medicines/			 883	 552</p>
<p>pharmaceuticals</p>
<p>    7.  Textiles/fabrics		277	n.a.</p>
<p>    8. Printed matter		   204	 263</p>
<p>    9. Assorted chemicals	     188	  93</p>
<p>    10.  Raw plastics			   33.7    41.5</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
